WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:02.950
Mars base Bravo needs food. Can you deliver it?

2
00:00:03.150 --> 00:00:06.400
First, launch your rocket. Drop each stage on time!

3
00:00:06.650 --> 00:00:09.900
Build your rover. Every kilogram counts!

4
00:00:10.150 --> 00:00:13.900
Drive across Mars. Watch your oxygen and battery.

5
00:00:14.150 --> 00:00:17.900
A dust storm is coming. Build a shelter!

6
00:00:18.150 --> 00:00:20.900
Real Mars storms can block the sun for weeks.

7
00:00:21.150 --> 00:00:23.900
Solar flare! Shield your crew from radiation.

8
00:00:24.150 --> 00:00:26.900
Deliver the food to Bravo, trip by trip.

9
00:00:27.300 --> 00:00:29.850
Plan, make trade-offs, and think like an astronaut!
